# AIONS Control Plane (Faza 3)

- New decision logic → `control_plane/` (`policy.py`, `planner.py`, `executor.py`).
- Extend `server/app.py` via routers; do not add 500-line blocks to `mcpServers/.../server.py`.
- Max **3 new MCP tools** per control-plane iteration: `aions_plan`, `aions_execute_step`, `aions_execution_status`.
- CBMS lookup before planning; audit trail JSONL for every execution step.
